      },
      {
        "id": "thread-safe-hierarchies",
        "says": "When a base class promises thread safety, every subclass must keep it, for example by not overriding a synchronized method without synchronization.",
        "basis": [
          "section:8.1.3.4. LSP and Thread Safety in Inheritance Hierarchies"
